'''Saki Matsuga & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] and was obtainable during the [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 423
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Saki Matsuga & Cat
|name2 = Saki Matsuga & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Saki Matsuga & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Saki Matsuga is a decent crowd-controller on paper, but sadly fails due to two major reasons. Her guaranteed weaken with nearly full uptime (assuming you have all [[Fruit Treasures]]) would be good, if not for the existence of [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]]. Thaumaturge has full uptime, higher range, quicker recharge, more targeted traits, and even access to [[Talents]]. The second reason she fails is because Weaken typically isn't all that useful, especially when there are powerful options for anti-Red crowd-controllers like [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]].

